{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"945b6f8dfa45653d22b9327d1dc730561b628205ad5daf271c1c581611326055","digest":{"component_or_area":"doctor lock census","key_entities":["rebar._snapshot.gc_trigger._WORKER_LOCK_NAME","rebar._snapshot.repo_snapshot.store_root()","rebar._snapshot.repo_snapshot.peek_store_root()","rebar._snapshot.gc_trigger._GC_DIRNAME","rebar._snapshot.gc_trigger.worker_lock_probe_path()","rebar._store.stamped_lock.stamped_file_lock","rebar._store.lock_owner.stamped_file_is_stale","doctor_locks.scan_locks","doctor_locks._existence_report","src/rebar/_commands/doctor_locks.py","src/rebar/_snapshot/repo_snapshot.py","src/rebar/_snapshot/gc_trigger.py","src/rebar/schemas/doctor.schema.json","tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor_locks.py","LEG_SNAPSHOT_GC_WORKER","REBAR_GATE_TMPDIR"],"problem_keywords":["lock census","snapshot GC","worker lock","staleness detection","diagnostic probe","read-only derivation"],"propositions":["Snapshot GC worker locks at <snapshot-store>/gc/worker.lock are not visible to doctor's lock census, leaving stale locks undetected when the worker dies between acquire and release.","The snapshot-GC worker lock must be added as a sixth leg to doctor's census using the existing _existence_report and shared stamped_file_is_stale table for staleness adjudication.","Lock derivation must be read-only and not create directories; peek_store_root() is needed to resolve the per-host snapshot-store path without mkdir/chmod side effects.","Doctor census tests must pin REBAR_GATE_TMPDIR to prevent the new host-global snapshot leg from leaking real host state into test assertions.","The snapshot-gc-worker leg reports stale findings for dead holders, info for live holders, and no finding for absent stores or free locks."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787723849394249001,"uuid":"6937cb28-4ad2-4814-9a04-14234220bdad"}